---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={`Portfolio | ${SITE_TITLE}`} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<section id="voice" aria-labelledby="voice-heading">
				<h2 id="voice-heading">Voice Acting</h2>
				<p>
					I have much experience as a voice actor, working with prominent modders in the StarCraft 2 community like <a
					href="https://synergymods.com/"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer">Synergy</a
				> and lunchbox to make their projects come to life.  I also have significant experience managing projects, with many of my <a
					href="https://youtu.be/k1D4ClMmOhg"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer">personal projects</a
				> as well as modding ones requiring keeping track of many other actors' progress, ensuring proper line delivery, coaching, and directing. Included below is a link to a reel of some of my best work, as well as an excerpt of The Yellow Wallpaper read live on stage.
				</p>
				<div class="card-row">
					<article class="mini-card">
						<a
							class="mini-card-link"
							href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CyeBQl6fu8M"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener noreferrer">
							<img
								src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/CyeBQl6fu8M/hqdefault.jpg"
								alt="YouTube video thumbnail"
								loading="lazy"
							/>
						</a>
					</article>
					<article class="mini-card">
						<a
							class="mini-card-link"
							href="https://youtu.be/zPV4M9pLUg8"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener noreferrer">
							<img
								src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/zPV4M9pLUg8/hqdefault.jpg"
								alt="YouTube video thumbnail"
								loading="lazy"
							/>
						</a>
					</article>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section id="audio" aria-labelledby="audio-heading">
				<h2 id="audio-heading">Audio Engineering</h2>
				<p>
					I am a formally educated Audio Engineer, having graduated at <a
					href="https://www.cras.edu/"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer">Conservatory of Recording Arts & Sciences</a
				> near the top of my class, and interned at <a
					href="https://www.thetonefactory.com/"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer">The Tone Factory Recording Studios</a
				> for a time.  I have ample experience in music production, having written, recorded, and produced my own music as well as recorded for and with other artists.  I am also the premier audio engineer for a <a
					href="https://www.youtube.com/@velaroniasunstryder6014"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer">local filmmaker</a
				>, ensuring proper foley, dialogue, and music balance and quality.  In addition, I am the second primary audio engineer for the <a
					href="https://bealestreettheater.com/"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer">Beale Street Theater</a
				>, providing live audio, as well as recording and mixing services there.  Linked below are my latest music project as well as a local filmmaker's project where I was in charge of all audio, including the soundfont of the music.
				</p>
				<div class="card-row">
					<article class="mini-card">
						<a
							class="mini-card-link"
							href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iW5plHNzoIU"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener noreferrer">
							<img
								src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/iW5plHNzoIU/hqdefault.jpg"
								alt="YouTube video thumbnail"
								loading="lazy"
							/>
						</a>
					</article>
					<article class="mini-card">
						<a
							class="mini-card-link"
							href="https://youtu.be/Bps6bZal4eA"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener noreferrer">
							<img
								src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/Bps6bZal4eA/hqdefault.jpg"
								alt="YouTube video thumbnail"
								loading="lazy"
							/>
						</a>
					</article>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section id="video" aria-labelledby="video-heading">
				<h2 id="video-heading">Video Editing</h2>
				<p>
					I am a trained video editor, having edited videos on my own <a
					href="https://www.youtube.com/metalman1245"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer">YouTube channel</a
				> since 2018, editing professionally for two other YouTube channels for a time, as well as editing the pre-show advertisement for <a
					href="https://bealestreettheater.com/"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer">Beale Street Theater</a
				> for the vast majority of shows.  I have ample experience working on video projects completely solo, and collaborating with other editors simultaneously and sequentially.  I work primarily in Davinci Resolve but have experience using other NLEs.  Linked below is a trailer for a StarCraft II modding project I was a co-author for, and a recent video edited for a YouTuber client.
				</p>
				<div class="card-row">
					<article class="mini-card">
						<a
							class="mini-card-link"
							href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ukYgmuKl1v0"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener noreferrer">
							<img
								src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/ukYgmuKl1v0/hqdefault.jpg"
								alt="YouTube video thumbnail"
								loading="lazy"
							/>
						</a>
					</article>
					<article class="mini-card">
						<a
							class="mini-card-link"
							href="https://youtu.be/pppiQ4hBqVw"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener noreferrer">
							<img
								src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/pppiQ4hBqVw/hqdefault.jpg"
								alt="YouTube video thumbnail"
								loading="lazy"
							/>
						</a>
					</article>
				</div>
			</section>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	main {
		width: 960px;
		max-width: calc(100% - 2em);
		margin: auto;
		padding: 3em 1em;
	}

	section + section {
		margin-top: 3em;
	}

	section h2 {
		border-bottom: 2px solid rgb(var(--gray-light));
		padding-bottom: 0.25em;
		margin-bottom: 1em;
	}

	p {
		font-size: 1em;
		line-height: 1.7;
		margin-bottom: 1em;
	}

	.card-row {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
		gap: 1em;
		margin-top: 1em;
	}

	.mini-card {
		overflow: hidden;
		border-radius: 8px;
		background: white;
		box-shadow: var(--box-shadow);
	}

	.mini-card-link,
	.mini-card-link img {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
	}

	.mini-card-link img {
		object-fit: cover;
		border-radius: 0;
	}

	@media (max-width: 600px) {
		.card-row {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}
</style>
